WEBVTT

00:00.837 --> 00:01.967
[birds chirping]

00:02.007 --> 00:03.807
MUSHOKU TENSEI JOBLESS
REINCARNATION III

00:04.507 --> 00:07.217
[floorboards creaking]

00:20.697 --> 00:22.657
[groans]

00:30.287 --> 00:32.577
[RUDEUS] Before me, a deity.

00:33.837 --> 00:35.287
[gasps]

00:35.337 --> 00:37.757
[♪ gentle music playing]

00:39.337 --> 00:42.637
A deity in repose.
A bodhisattva! The Buddha!

00:42.677 --> 00:46.427
A holy figure to whom
I must show the utmost respect.

00:47.217 --> 00:48.477
[chuckles gleefully]

00:53.437 --> 00:54.687
[gasps softly]

00:55.687 --> 00:57.737
To one who didn't know her,

00:57.777 --> 01:00.067
she'd look far younger
than her years.

01:00.817 --> 01:01.907
But see there?

01:01.947 --> 01:04.447
A sacred urna on her chest.

01:04.487 --> 01:07.077
[groans] It's chilly.

01:07.907 --> 01:08.947
[gasps]

01:10.247 --> 01:11.787
[RUDEUS] After all these years,

01:11.827 --> 01:15.287
I can't believe I get to wake up
next to her like this.

01:15.337 --> 01:17.957
[gasps] Oh, shoot.
We should get moving.

01:18.007 --> 01:19.547
Uh...

01:19.917 --> 01:21.587
Roxy, are you awake?

01:21.627 --> 01:22.717
It's time to get up.

01:22.757 --> 01:23.967
Mm.

01:25.087 --> 01:26.297
Uh?

01:27.847 --> 01:29.517
Good morning.

01:30.057 --> 01:31.137
[gasps]

01:31.177 --> 01:32.637
Yeah, good morning.

01:32.687 --> 01:33.937
Are you...

01:34.477 --> 01:36.357
Uh, is something wrong?

01:36.397 --> 01:38.397
Why do you look so disappointed?

01:38.437 --> 01:39.857
It's fine.

01:39.897 --> 01:42.447
I was just hoping I might get
a better look at my wife

01:42.487 --> 01:44.277
in this soft morning light,
is all.

01:44.317 --> 01:45.407
[gasps]

01:46.277 --> 01:48.367
Rudy. No, we should hurry.

01:48.407 --> 01:50.657
I bet everyone else
is already awake.

01:53.077 --> 01:54.077
Right.

01:54.117 --> 01:55.997
[birds chirping]

02:02.047 --> 02:03.427
[RUDEUS] Morning, Sylphie.

02:03.927 --> 02:05.337
Good morning, Rudy.

02:06.967 --> 02:08.967
Lucie, say hi to Daddy.

02:09.007 --> 02:11.057
Hey there, sweet little Lucie.

02:11.517 --> 02:13.637
Turns out
I never needed to worry.

02:13.687 --> 02:15.187
Lucie is doing great,

02:15.227 --> 02:17.347
and Sylphie
has recovered brilliantly.

02:17.647 --> 02:20.147
My girls
are the picture of health.

02:20.187 --> 02:22.687
She is just impossibly precious.

02:22.737 --> 02:24.397
I know, isn't she?

02:24.447 --> 02:26.567
How'd you get to be so adorable,
huh?

02:26.607 --> 02:28.777
She got it from her mom,
obviously.

02:29.487 --> 02:31.907
[SYLPHIETTE] Oh, Rudy,
you're so sweet.

02:32.247 --> 02:33.787
[gasps softly]

02:34.157 --> 02:35.157
[SYLPHIETTE] Uh...

02:35.667 --> 02:37.577
Hey, good morning, Roxy.

02:37.627 --> 02:38.667
[ROXY] Mm.

02:39.537 --> 02:41.457
Good morning to you too.

02:42.297 --> 02:44.047
So, your first night together.

02:44.087 --> 02:45.757
How was it? Did you have fun?

02:45.797 --> 02:47.257
-[Rudeus gasps]
-Oh, uh, yeah.

02:47.297 --> 02:50.007
Well, he was very good to me,

02:50.047 --> 02:52.017
and really gentle
the whole time.

02:52.057 --> 02:53.677
Um, actually, sorry.

02:53.727 --> 02:56.187
[chuckles] Oh, no,
don't apologize.

02:56.227 --> 02:57.517
Okay, if you're sure.

02:57.557 --> 02:58.727
'Course I am.

02:58.767 --> 03:00.767
[♪ gentle music playing]

03:02.147 --> 03:03.437
[RUDEUS] Good morning, Norn.

03:03.477 --> 03:05.317
And a good morning
to you, Rudeus.

03:05.357 --> 03:07.777
I wrote up a little more
of Ruijerd's story

03:07.817 --> 03:09.197
last night before I went to bed,

03:09.237 --> 03:11.277
if you feel like
reading it over later.

03:11.327 --> 03:12.367
Well, yeah.

03:12.947 --> 03:15.037
I had planned to write
this book about Ruijerd

03:15.077 --> 03:17.497
for some positive Superd PR,

03:17.537 --> 03:19.827
but Norn has mostly
taken over now.

03:20.167 --> 03:21.167
She's still learning,

03:21.537 --> 03:23.507
but with what I've seen her do
in school so far,

03:23.547 --> 03:26.627
she'll turn out a better story
than I ever could.

03:27.337 --> 03:29.297
I can't wait to read it.

03:33.717 --> 03:35.387
Hey, Mom. Morning.

03:36.557 --> 03:38.897
Look, Mom, it's Rudeus.

03:43.477 --> 03:44.527
Hmm.

03:45.107 --> 03:48.067
[RUDEUS] It's been a few months
since we returned to Sharia,

03:48.697 --> 03:51.407
but Zenith still
hasn't recovered her memory.

03:51.447 --> 03:54.197
She seems to be improving
little by little,

03:54.237 --> 03:56.367
but all we can do
is wait and see.

03:57.917 --> 03:59.537
[AISHA] ♪ Breakfast time! ♪

03:59.577 --> 04:00.877
♪ Breakfast time! ♪

04:00.917 --> 04:03.497
Breakfast is served,
friends and lovers!

04:06.257 --> 04:07.467
Good day, brother.

04:07.507 --> 04:08.967
Good day to you all.

04:09.007 --> 04:10.677
Good morning, Aisha.

04:10.717 --> 04:12.717
What do we have
for breakfast today?

04:12.757 --> 04:14.467
Oh, nothing special.

04:14.507 --> 04:16.677
Pretty much the same stuff
we always have.

04:16.717 --> 04:17.847
-[LILIA] Aisha.
-[gasps]

04:17.887 --> 04:19.227
Don't be difficult now.

04:19.267 --> 04:20.937
You were asked
a direct question,

04:20.977 --> 04:22.437
and you should answer it.

04:22.477 --> 04:24.397
We have yoco bean
and tuber soup

04:24.437 --> 04:25.727
with fresh-baked wheat bread

04:25.777 --> 04:27.857
and a pitcher
of nourishing mare's milk.

04:28.447 --> 04:31.987
Master Rudeus, Madam Sylphiette,
and Madam Roxy,

04:32.027 --> 04:33.067
good morning.

04:33.617 --> 04:34.827
[RUDEUS] Good morning, Lilia.

04:35.907 --> 04:38.577
Aisha and Lilia are back
to running the house together,

04:39.037 --> 04:40.117
just like old times.

04:40.157 --> 04:41.287
Okay!

04:41.327 --> 04:43.327
[RUDEUS]
Aisha can be a real handful,

04:43.377 --> 04:46.047
and sometimes I think
it drives Lilia up the wall,

04:46.087 --> 04:47.587
but they both seem happy.

04:48.627 --> 04:50.837
And after being scattered
all over the world,

04:51.427 --> 04:53.717
the fact that we made it back
together again...

04:54.887 --> 04:57.387
what more
could I possibly ask for?

04:57.927 --> 05:00.137
All right, let's dig in.

05:01.517 --> 05:03.307
[whooshing]

05:03.857 --> 05:07.437
[creatures call]

05:08.737 --> 05:10.107
♪

05:14.407 --> 05:15.827
[RUDEUS] It's the first day
back at school

05:15.867 --> 05:18.247
in a long time
for Sylphie and me,

05:18.657 --> 05:20.407
and even longer for her.

05:21.037 --> 05:23.627
Uh, what are you staring at?

05:23.667 --> 05:25.497
My cute wife, is all.

05:25.837 --> 05:26.877
Yeah, yeah.

05:26.917 --> 05:28.627
Hey, have you had the chance

05:28.667 --> 05:31.297
to introduce Roxy
to everybody at school?

05:31.337 --> 05:32.297
Sure have.

05:32.337 --> 05:34.137
When I recommended Master Roxy

05:34.177 --> 05:35.637
to the university
as an instructor,

05:35.677 --> 05:38.097
I made sure that literally
everyone on campus

05:38.137 --> 05:40.347
understands
how wonderful she is.

05:40.387 --> 05:42.187
Her mastery
of her craft is sublime,

05:42.227 --> 05:43.687
and inviting her
to share that expertise

05:43.767 --> 05:46.647
would be an incredible boon
to the premier magic academy

05:46.687 --> 05:48.067
of these great lands.

05:48.517 --> 05:49.527
[chuckles proudly]

05:49.567 --> 05:50.987
That sure sounds like you.

05:52.987 --> 05:55.317
I really do appreciate
you introducing me

05:55.357 --> 05:56.737
to everyone, Rudy.

05:56.777 --> 05:57.737
But, uh,

05:58.117 --> 06:00.407
you only ever introduced me
as your former master.

06:00.447 --> 06:02.407
You never said
that I'm your wife too.

06:02.447 --> 06:03.827
[gasps]

06:04.167 --> 06:05.247
Is that so?

06:05.287 --> 06:07.207
[Rudeus gasps] I'm so sorry!

06:07.707 --> 06:11.757
Oh, Roxy, sweetheart,
I'm so sorry.

06:11.797 --> 06:12.877
I love you.

06:14.427 --> 06:16.587
Um, thank you. I love you too.

06:17.047 --> 06:20.057
Hey, husband. You got anything
to say to me?

06:20.597 --> 06:23.017
Of course I do,
my beautiful lady.

06:23.057 --> 06:25.057
You know just how I feel!

06:26.267 --> 06:27.727
I love you both!

06:27.767 --> 06:29.727
[students cheering]

06:29.767 --> 06:32.107
-Um, hey.
-Yeah, Rudy?

06:32.147 --> 06:33.897
Can we not do that
here at school?

06:33.947 --> 06:35.397
-[STUDENT] That's one lucky SOB!
-[ROXY] Please.

06:35.447 --> 06:38.487
Seriously, you're
embarrassing everyone here.

06:38.527 --> 06:42.617
[bell tolling]

06:43.407 --> 06:45.747
Okay, I gotta run.
I'll see you later.

06:45.787 --> 06:48.077
Sure. Have a good day at school.

06:48.377 --> 06:49.417
Thank you.

06:50.997 --> 06:54.337
Also, I wanna
come home again today.

06:58.677 --> 06:59.717
Morning, Norn.

06:59.757 --> 07:01.847
-Where have you been?
-[NORN] Sorry.

07:01.887 --> 07:03.427
Hey, Norn. What's going on?

07:03.467 --> 07:06.307
She's so sweet
and popular, it seems.

07:06.347 --> 07:08.107
Well, yeah. She is a cutie.

07:08.147 --> 07:11.107
I think it's because everyone
can see how hard she's working.

07:11.147 --> 07:12.897
Can't help but root for her.

07:13.527 --> 07:15.817
[RUDEUS] As her brother,
I'm glad she's well-liked.

07:16.357 --> 07:19.527
But if any one of those guys
so much as lays a hand on her,

07:19.567 --> 07:21.157
I'll make them regret it.

07:21.777 --> 07:24.747
No way am I gonna let some rando
creep on my little sister!

07:24.787 --> 07:26.497
Norn already has plans
to come with us.

07:26.537 --> 07:28.127
[RUDEUS] Don't worry, Dad.
I got her.

07:28.167 --> 07:29.497
We can all go together.

07:30.497 --> 07:31.997
[scribbling]

07:33.417 --> 07:34.837
[knocking at door]

07:35.377 --> 07:37.177
-Come in.
-[door opens]

07:37.217 --> 07:38.337
[RUDEUS] Hello, sir.

07:38.387 --> 07:39.547
[door closes]

07:41.347 --> 07:43.387
Um, pardon the intrusion.

07:44.097 --> 07:46.517
[JENIUS] Not at all.
I've been expecting you.

07:47.137 --> 07:50.307
Rudeus, you'll be returning
to your studies today?

07:50.357 --> 07:52.857
Yes, sir.
And it's a breath of fresh air.

07:52.897 --> 07:55.397
I'm very glad to be back
under your tutelage.

07:55.437 --> 07:56.527
You flatter me.

07:56.567 --> 07:58.447
Glad to have you back, Rudeus.

07:59.277 --> 08:03.237
And Roxy, this will be your
first day as an instructor here.

08:03.617 --> 08:04.907
Are you nervous at all?

08:04.947 --> 08:06.997
Yes. Mm.

08:08.117 --> 08:09.167
Only a little.

08:09.207 --> 08:10.287
Ah.

08:10.917 --> 08:14.497
My, what happened to the Roxy
who had no fear to speak of?

08:14.547 --> 08:16.377
That young know-it-all I taught?

08:16.417 --> 08:19.677
Right?
I'm kind of surprised too.

08:19.717 --> 08:22.347
I was pretty full of myself
back then, huh?

08:22.387 --> 08:24.887
But now,
I have a lot more humility

08:24.927 --> 08:26.387
and a much greater appreciation

08:26.427 --> 08:28.387
for the joy
of teaching other people.

08:29.887 --> 08:30.887
Hmm.

08:31.227 --> 08:34.017
Well, we're glad to have you,
good Master Roxy.

08:34.647 --> 08:35.647
Thanks.

08:37.397 --> 08:40.197
Okay. I think I'm gonna
head over to class now.

08:40.237 --> 08:42.567
Right. See you later.

08:42.617 --> 08:44.697
[indistinct chatter]

08:45.697 --> 08:48.037
Good morning, every-- Hmm?

08:48.077 --> 08:50.367
Guess I'm the first person
here today.

08:50.787 --> 08:52.127
[LINIA] Oh, boss!

08:52.707 --> 08:54.497
Top o' the meowing to ya.

08:54.537 --> 08:56.127
Heya, how's it going?

08:56.167 --> 08:57.707
Good morning, you two.

08:58.417 --> 09:00.587
We see you,
you old hound dog.

09:00.627 --> 09:03.547
Showing up with not one
but two beautiful women in tow.

09:03.587 --> 09:04.597
Must be nice.

09:05.177 --> 09:07.757
Typical guy. Ditch us and then
go parade around your second.

09:07.807 --> 09:08.807
Well, nuhni.

09:08.847 --> 09:10.597
Well, we're graduating
this year.

09:10.637 --> 09:12.637
We're gonna find someone
sooner or later.

09:12.687 --> 09:13.687
Got that right.

09:13.727 --> 09:15.227
This year, we duel to the death!

09:15.267 --> 09:18.067
I'm taking home a man
or I'll die trying!

09:18.107 --> 09:20.437
[LINIA] Yeah, I'll catch myself
a good one. [laughs]

09:20.487 --> 09:21.487
[RUDEUS]
They've always acted like

09:21.607 --> 09:23.197
they didn't have time
for romance.

09:24.067 --> 09:26.237
I guess seeing me
with a beauty on each arm

09:26.277 --> 09:27.907
has them a little jealous.

09:27.947 --> 09:29.077
-[ZANOBA] Master?
-Uh.

09:29.157 --> 09:31.577
You've come back, Master.
How wonderful!

09:31.617 --> 09:32.827
Good morning, sir!

09:32.867 --> 09:35.537
Hello, Grand Master.
And good morning to you.

09:35.577 --> 09:37.167
Morning there, Zanoba.

09:37.587 --> 09:39.167
How's it going, Julie?

09:39.207 --> 09:41.297
[ZANOBA] If you're here,
does that mean

09:41.337 --> 09:42.467
you'll be rejoining us?

09:42.587 --> 09:45.177
You know it. I'm ready
to hit the books again.

09:45.217 --> 09:47.217
[ZANOBA] Oh, music to my ears!

09:47.257 --> 09:49.807
Uh, then I have something
I'd like you to look at later.

09:49.847 --> 09:51.477
You're working on something new?

09:51.517 --> 09:52.517
[chuckles smugly]

09:53.597 --> 09:56.807
Only the fruits of
the past six months of research!

09:57.267 --> 09:58.267
[chuckles excitedly]

09:58.317 --> 10:00.437
Yeah, great!
That sounds intense.

10:00.487 --> 10:01.687
Can't wait. Uh.

10:08.367 --> 10:10.037
[coughs]

10:10.077 --> 10:11.157
[RUDEUS] Morning.

10:11.787 --> 10:12.957
Good morning.

10:12.997 --> 10:14.207
[coughing]

10:14.247 --> 10:15.417
Are you okay?

10:16.167 --> 10:17.707
Yeah, I'm fine.

10:17.747 --> 10:19.587
Anyway, since you're at school,

10:19.627 --> 10:22.587
I assume you're not planning on
going anywhere for a while?

10:22.627 --> 10:23.667
Nope.

10:24.337 --> 10:25.387
Good.

10:25.757 --> 10:28.297
I can continue to work
on my experiments then.

10:28.347 --> 10:29.387
[chuckles]

10:29.427 --> 10:30.387
[CLIFF] Rudeus!

10:31.057 --> 10:33.227
[RUDEUS] Hello, Cliff.
It's good to see you!

10:33.267 --> 10:36.607
I only knew you came back
to school because of Lise.

10:36.637 --> 10:37.807
Would it have killed you to come

10:37.857 --> 10:39.937
and spare a hello
at the very least?

10:39.977 --> 10:41.487
I would have loved to.

10:41.527 --> 10:43.777
I came by to see you,
but when I did...

10:44.317 --> 10:46.947
you and Elinalise
seemed a little busy.

10:46.987 --> 10:47.947
[gasps]

10:47.987 --> 10:49.527
Oh, I see.

10:50.077 --> 10:52.077
Well, I suppose
I can't blame you then.

10:52.117 --> 10:53.697
It was partly my fault.

10:54.367 --> 10:56.287
Regardless,
I would have appreciated

10:56.327 --> 10:58.837
hearing from you sooner
that your child was born.

10:59.377 --> 11:00.997
Yeah, I suppose that's fair.

11:01.037 --> 11:03.757
I'm sure the baby
is keeping you busy,

11:03.797 --> 11:04.967
but if I didn't know any better,

11:05.007 --> 11:06.877
I'd think
you'd been avoiding me.

11:07.507 --> 11:09.467
[RUDEUS]
Maybe he's onto something.

11:09.507 --> 11:11.717
He is a follower of Millis,
after all.

11:11.757 --> 11:13.177
Would anyone blame me
if I assumed

11:13.217 --> 11:15.847
he'd give me crap
for having two wives?

11:15.887 --> 11:17.267
Maybe I'm wrong,

11:17.307 --> 11:19.897
or is there a reason you didn't
want to come visit me?

11:19.937 --> 11:21.017
[smirks]

11:22.397 --> 11:23.527
[sighs nervously]

11:24.237 --> 11:25.437
Thing is, I've taken--

11:25.487 --> 11:27.147
[JENIUS]
Good morning, gentlemen.

11:27.987 --> 11:29.527
Now it's time
to take your seats.

11:29.567 --> 11:30.777
[gasps]

11:31.367 --> 11:33.997
I am Roxy Migurdia Greyrat.

11:34.037 --> 11:35.497
[JENIUS] Starting today,

11:35.657 --> 11:39.287
Mrs. Greyrat will be teaching at
the Ranoa University of Magic.

11:39.327 --> 11:41.587
She will be
your class's new professor,

11:41.627 --> 11:43.297
but I shall stay a while longer

11:43.337 --> 11:45.667
to assist during
her transition into the role.

11:45.707 --> 11:48.587
So please,
be on your best behavior.

11:49.217 --> 11:50.507
Though I'm new, I believe

11:50.547 --> 11:52.677
I've already been introduced
to many of you,

11:52.717 --> 11:53.927
but in case I haven't,

11:53.967 --> 11:56.477
I am the second wife
of Rudeus Greyrat there.

11:56.517 --> 11:57.477
[gasps]

11:58.057 --> 11:59.847
[ROXY] Outside the classroom,
our relationships may differ,

11:59.897 --> 12:01.017
but within these walls,

12:01.057 --> 12:03.017
you are all my students.

12:03.647 --> 12:05.067
Huh?

12:05.107 --> 12:08.947
Did I hear her say
your second wife?

12:11.157 --> 12:12.197
[sighs]

12:13.907 --> 12:15.697
[Juliette, Zanoba sigh uneasily]

12:19.157 --> 12:20.327
[sighs]

12:21.037 --> 12:22.337
Oh, Rudeus.

12:22.377 --> 12:24.837
Are you just incapable
of being faithful?

12:24.877 --> 12:26.417
Who's to say?

12:26.457 --> 12:29.627
I mean, yeah, I guess I could
have tried a bit harder at it.

12:31.137 --> 12:32.757
Here's the thing.

12:32.797 --> 12:33.967
I blessed you that day

12:34.257 --> 12:36.887
because you said you'd love
Sylphie and Sylphie alone.

12:36.927 --> 12:38.477
[RUDEUS] Yeah, I-I know,

12:38.517 --> 12:41.647
and I'm still grateful
for your kind words that day.

12:41.687 --> 12:45.567
Listen, I know you're not
a follower of Millis like me,

12:45.607 --> 12:47.777
so I'll just leave it at that,
okay?

12:48.317 --> 12:50.777
No, in fact, I'll celebrate.

12:52.237 --> 12:53.407
Well done.

12:54.027 --> 12:56.077
[RUDEUS] That means a lot.
Thank you.

12:58.247 --> 12:59.747
[sighs]

13:00.907 --> 13:03.127
[CLIFF] Sometimes
when I'm at the church in town,

13:03.167 --> 13:04.497
I see your sister.

13:04.537 --> 13:05.837
[gasps]

13:05.877 --> 13:08.007
And you know what she told me?

13:08.047 --> 13:10.837
That someday she wants
to be happily married

13:10.877 --> 13:13.677
just like her big brother
and his wife, Sylphie.

13:14.387 --> 13:17.177
When you came back home
with a second wife in tow,

13:17.217 --> 13:18.807
how did your sister react?

13:19.677 --> 13:22.187
Uh, she was furious.

13:22.227 --> 13:24.017
I bet she was, yeah.

13:24.057 --> 13:25.937
She was at the church
almost every day

13:25.977 --> 13:28.437
praying that you and your father
would come home.

13:28.487 --> 13:30.737
So when you did return
safe and alive,

13:30.777 --> 13:33.277
I'm sure
she was overcome with relief.

13:33.857 --> 13:35.817
But now that
she's lost her father,

13:35.867 --> 13:38.287
you're all she has left
in this world.

13:38.867 --> 13:40.407
Before you make big decisions,

13:40.457 --> 13:41.867
don't you think
you should consider

13:41.907 --> 13:44.287
-how they'll affect Norn?
-Yeah.

13:44.957 --> 13:46.997
It's not good
to have too many spouses,

13:47.037 --> 13:48.757
not for you or for them.

13:49.047 --> 13:50.417
I suppose.

13:51.257 --> 13:53.087
But hey,
while we're on the subject--

13:53.127 --> 13:54.757
[CLIFF] What is it, Rudeus?

13:54.797 --> 13:57.717
It sounds like you've been
keeping an eye on Norn for me,

13:57.757 --> 13:59.217
so, you know, thanks for that.

14:00.477 --> 14:01.847
Well, I merely saw her

14:01.887 --> 14:04.187
and thought
she needed a friendly ear.

14:04.227 --> 14:05.397
[gasps]

14:05.437 --> 14:06.647
By the way,

14:06.767 --> 14:09.227
don't let her walk around town
alone at her age.

14:09.267 --> 14:11.437
This may be a safe neighborhood,

14:11.487 --> 14:14.277
but in the back alleys,
kidnappers lurk in the shadows.

14:14.317 --> 14:17.027
Fair point.
I'll remember that next time.

14:17.067 --> 14:18.407
Will you really?

14:18.447 --> 14:19.447
Because you always seem to--

14:19.487 --> 14:20.827
Easy, Master Cliff.

14:20.867 --> 14:22.287
Why don't we leave it at that?

14:22.327 --> 14:25.207
After all, he has come back
to us safe and sound.

14:25.247 --> 14:26.327
[CLIFF] Hmm.

14:26.497 --> 14:29.667
Well, at least
he appears somewhat repentant.

14:29.707 --> 14:31.837
I shall forgive you
for your sins.

14:32.297 --> 14:35.427
Great Millis is magnanimous,
therefore, so am I.

14:35.467 --> 14:37.257
I really appreciate it.

14:37.297 --> 14:38.757
[grunts]

14:41.887 --> 14:43.767
Elise told me the story,

14:43.807 --> 14:46.687
but was the thing that took
your hand really that dangerous?

14:48.107 --> 14:50.397
[RUDEUS] A hydra,
and my magic had no effect.

14:50.437 --> 14:52.737
It was immune to magic?

14:52.777 --> 14:55.317
I can understand
why you struggled with it.

14:55.857 --> 14:57.197
I'm amazed you're alive.

14:57.237 --> 14:59.777
I only survived
thanks to my dad.

15:00.407 --> 15:01.947
We may have won the battle,

15:02.327 --> 15:04.827
but that victory came
at a heavy cost.

15:08.377 --> 15:09.997
Master, before you leave,

15:10.037 --> 15:11.627
let us show you something.

15:15.547 --> 15:17.387
Feast your eyes upon this glove!

15:17.427 --> 15:19.097
That is a glove.

15:19.137 --> 15:20.637
[ZANOBA] Yeah,
the one I mentioned to you

15:20.677 --> 15:21.717
in class earlier.

15:21.927 --> 15:23.807
You can call it
the fruits of our research.

15:23.847 --> 15:25.597
[ZANOBA] Now,
hold out your left arm.

15:25.637 --> 15:26.927
Uh, okay.

15:28.477 --> 15:30.807
[Zanoba grunting, muttering]

15:30.857 --> 15:31.937
There it is.

15:34.487 --> 15:36.147
Won't it fall off, though?

15:36.187 --> 15:39.567
[ZANOBA] Uh, the incantation is,
"O Earth, become my arm."

15:39.617 --> 15:40.657
Pardon?

15:40.907 --> 15:42.487
[ZANOBA] Go ahead.
Why don't you give it a shot?

15:44.367 --> 15:47.037
O Earth, become my arm.

15:52.997 --> 15:54.167
[gasps]

15:56.797 --> 15:58.007
Whoa!

15:58.047 --> 16:00.297
No way! It can move!

16:00.337 --> 16:02.047
Here, let's shake.

16:05.267 --> 16:06.477
That's incredible.

16:06.637 --> 16:08.807
I can even feel the fingertips
like they're my own!

16:08.847 --> 16:09.937
So what is this thing?

16:10.437 --> 16:13.607
A new magical implement that
moves exactly as you will it to.

16:13.647 --> 16:15.357
While analyzing the automaton,

16:15.397 --> 16:16.567
I turned to Cliff
for assistance,

16:16.607 --> 16:18.817
and we reached
this point together.

16:19.527 --> 16:20.817
Because of our research,

16:20.867 --> 16:22.777
I can now restrain
my freakish strength

16:22.827 --> 16:24.737
and delicately sculpt figurines.

16:24.787 --> 16:26.367
[RUDEUS] Wow, that's amazing!

16:26.407 --> 16:28.207
But if you want
even more strength,

16:28.247 --> 16:30.457
feed it mana,
and its power will increase.

16:30.957 --> 16:32.207
Oh?

16:33.667 --> 16:36.257
-[creaks]
-[yells in pain]

16:36.297 --> 16:38.797
You're angry about what
I said earlier...

16:38.837 --> 16:40.177
Well, we weren't actually sure

16:40.217 --> 16:41.967
if you could operate it
with a missing hand,

16:42.007 --> 16:44.427
but I'd wager it appears
to be working just fine.

16:44.467 --> 16:48.057
So, do you think it's possible
to do magic with this hand now?

16:48.097 --> 16:49.137
[ZANOBA] Hmm.

16:49.347 --> 16:51.647
Let go already.
At least loosen your-- Hey!

16:51.687 --> 16:54.017
I know!
We shall perform an experiment.

16:54.057 --> 16:56.607
[indistinct chatter]

16:59.527 --> 17:00.857
What is that?

17:00.897 --> 17:02.447
You think
it might be another duel?

17:02.487 --> 17:03.777
What?

17:04.487 --> 17:05.657
[thuds]

17:07.697 --> 17:09.957
Everything is ready,
Grand Master!

17:10.287 --> 17:11.957
Okay, give it a try.

17:11.997 --> 17:12.957
Mm.

17:12.997 --> 17:14.077
All right, here goes!

17:14.207 --> 17:16.087
-[ZANOBA] Ooh.
-[JULIETTE] Go, go, go, go.

17:25.927 --> 17:27.137
[gasps in awe]

17:42.697 --> 17:44.157
[chuckles in awe]

17:44.197 --> 17:45.867
[CLIFF] It's obvious
you can cast spells

17:45.907 --> 17:47.487
when you wear it
without an issue.

17:47.537 --> 17:48.537
I'll say!

17:48.577 --> 17:50.247
[chuckles excitedly]

17:50.287 --> 17:52.707
That was magnificent!
You never disappoint.

17:52.747 --> 17:54.377
It's one hell of an invention!

17:54.417 --> 17:56.037
Honestly, I'm blown away!

17:56.077 --> 17:57.747
Aw, thank you, Master.

17:57.797 --> 17:59.047
If you wish to keep it,

17:59.087 --> 18:01.297
I'd be more than happy
to give it to you.

18:01.337 --> 18:03.007
Uh, are you serious?

18:03.047 --> 18:05.337
[ZANOBA] Of course.
While it's only a prototype,

18:05.387 --> 18:07.757
I should think that
it's better than nothing.

18:07.807 --> 18:09.637
And now that
you've safely returned,

18:09.677 --> 18:11.017
you and Cliff can assist me

18:11.057 --> 18:13.937
so I can whip up a similar piece
in no time at all.

18:13.977 --> 18:15.607
Hmm. I'm curious.

18:15.647 --> 18:17.647
Does this thing of yours
have a name yet?

18:18.567 --> 18:21.357
No, we haven't decided
on a name just yet.

18:21.397 --> 18:23.857
Neither Cliff nor I
have much expertise

18:23.897 --> 18:26.197
in the sacred art
of naming our inventions.

18:26.567 --> 18:29.657
Since you're here, would you
mind doing the honor for us?

18:29.697 --> 18:32.367
Oh, yes, what a marvelous idea!

18:32.407 --> 18:33.617
Uh...

18:36.787 --> 18:37.917
Hmm.

18:39.167 --> 18:40.167
[gasps]

18:40.547 --> 18:43.167
Well, in that case,
I'll name it for both of you.

18:43.207 --> 18:45.167
We can call it
the Hand of Zaliff.

18:45.757 --> 18:48.097
You realize you left
your name out, right?

18:48.137 --> 18:49.137
I know.

18:49.177 --> 18:50.887
I mean,
I didn't help you make it.

18:51.267 --> 18:53.057
But to say
that you played no part

18:53.097 --> 18:54.767
would be a genuine lie.

18:56.647 --> 18:57.687
[both chuckle]

18:58.687 --> 19:00.567
What's done is done. And now,

19:00.607 --> 19:04.897
that prototype shall henceforth
be known as the Hand of Zaliff.

19:18.537 --> 19:20.087
-[door opens]
-Huh?

19:20.127 --> 19:21.337
[gasps]

19:21.377 --> 19:22.497
[gasps excitedly]

19:24.047 --> 19:27.047
Hey, Big Brother! Welcome home!

19:27.087 --> 19:29.297
[giggling]

19:30.677 --> 19:33.637
Would you like dinner?
Or a nice bath?

19:33.677 --> 19:35.597
Or maybe you could just...

19:36.177 --> 19:38.477
play with me?

19:40.147 --> 19:41.397
Play with you?

19:41.437 --> 19:44.147
Let's see if I've grown
too strong to play!

19:44.187 --> 19:46.277
Oh, I'm not strong enough,
it seems!

19:46.317 --> 19:48.397
[laughing] Big Brother's
attacking me!

19:48.447 --> 19:49.947
That tickles!

19:49.987 --> 19:51.197
[gasps]

19:54.117 --> 19:55.237
I'm all back.

19:55.827 --> 19:57.287
[♪ gentle music playing]

20:00.577 --> 20:03.547
So, is your new hand
a magical implement?

20:03.587 --> 20:07.417
It is. It only exists because of
Zanoba and Cliff's research.

20:07.467 --> 20:08.467
It's so lifelike,

20:08.547 --> 20:10.047
I can hardly tell
it's a prosthetic

20:10.087 --> 20:11.137
by the way it moves.

20:11.177 --> 20:12.557
And the range of motion
is crazy.

20:12.597 --> 20:13.597
When I get used to it,

20:13.677 --> 20:15.517
I'll be back to normal
and then some.

20:15.557 --> 20:17.017
Think about it.

20:17.217 --> 20:20.647
Now I've got twice as many hands
to get handsy with both of you!

20:20.687 --> 20:22.017
[SYLPHIETTE] Really, Rudy?

20:22.147 --> 20:24.107
[ROXY] Hey! Where do you think
you’re touching me?

20:24.147 --> 20:26.607
Brother, why must you
embarrass me like this?

20:26.647 --> 20:28.437
[AISHA] ♪ Dinner for you! ♪

20:28.487 --> 20:29.907
♪ Dinner for you! ♪

20:29.947 --> 20:32.577
♪ I've got
Some dinner for you! ♪

20:34.277 --> 20:35.827
If you liked yesterday's menu,

20:35.867 --> 20:37.827
then I hope
you'll like it today too!

20:37.867 --> 20:39.207
Aisha, please.

20:39.247 --> 20:40.827
Yeah.

20:41.537 --> 20:42.877
[ALL] Thank you for this meal!

20:44.087 --> 20:46.167
[RUDEUS] I still can't believe
how much has happened

20:46.207 --> 20:48.917
since the mass teleportation
in Fittoa.

20:49.627 --> 20:51.717
Adventuring
on the Demon Continent,

20:51.757 --> 20:53.177
parting ways with Eris,

20:53.597 --> 20:56.717
curing my condition,
marrying Sylphie,

20:57.557 --> 21:00.187
reuniting with Roxy,
rescuing Mom.

21:01.977 --> 21:04.147
I may have lost a lot
in this journey,

21:04.187 --> 21:08.317
but now, I've found my way back
to regular old life.

21:08.857 --> 21:13.317
And so, I'll cherish this normal
with everything I have.

21:13.367 --> 21:15.447
[♪ gentle music playing]

21:35.137 --> 21:36.717
[footsteps]

21:48.277 --> 21:51.947
Peaceful life is back,
and so are the old habits.

21:56.527 --> 22:00.617
Silently, I pray
to my holiest of idols.

22:01.867 --> 22:04.827
EPISODE 3
LIFE BACK AT HOME

22:04.877 --> 22:07.037
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:37.127 --> 23:39.967
NEXT TIME
A KING-CLASS WATER MAGE
